  <Callout kind="remember">
    The curve is a pure function from a flat coordinate to a quad, driven by
    two numbers: how much of the drum you see and how much the edge cell
    shrinks. It never moves a symbol; the motion layer stays flat and the
    bend is drawn on top, per symbol for free or per reel through a texture
    when you need everything to bend. Measure overlays through <code>getCellQuad</code> so they sit on the drum too.
  </Callout>
